<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Cameroonians serving in Russia's army were reported killed, prompting the African Bar Association to call for mediation in Cameroon. The UN Human Rights Committee released findings on Cameroon, while activist Agbor Balla reflected on a decade of bloodshed in the Anglophone crisis and questioned when children can safely return to school in the conflict zones. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxNaGUzZ2JCVjMwZnNyNzdBWG5kdFZ4N0pSVVVsLW9UdVd5SEl6MEZBLWdfUUNTbTZfaWFUY2t4SGFFWWFQdmxON28zbFI5Z0Y5VGxPdUFHbmJUUGVmMkRMRmp3bThvQXREZDB3cmtPT2IxNmZDdXNCYnBqODVzb2ZKeWNjLXNZYUJBT01xQVFpSlpxWUNLYlljOUZMMGJHMmU0MVNsbUdLSGF4VlZRSmdxSGkzSDZvcWg2eTAyUVd0QS1fTXBqMjFVVjNTRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Columbus Dispatch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPMVhBQm95UVJQVGhpUDJfcWhkNFFLLVpLYUNma0FLNk02TkJFRlpsUnV1NWMyNWVXbll5TDYzclNnUWQtaFB4alE3UlZUaURER2dzeWZOd1JZbTNtRkd2ZlFJdnk5b1pOeldIbUgyN3ZndFJfbTVDTk92NUMzdFFBYWVjSzRnMGJNMHZLY2pDQ2ZqWXQ5R1kzSXpfYXJqN25kS1RHLXlUR2NxazA3U0hIaEhwcU5ZQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sports Mole&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQT0NDaHBDRTdqT2xmU1VLbFliNHRSbTBudXFobi1wM0duOFFJNEdBNHBtWWdmVm4wcTZlam5KM2RuOEQxT3pGY1E0cVBqMllWcWU1OEg5ZXYzM2Zka09PenRGYld2ZDA2R3pCWjBET2tpb1l1NVJMWlhnRDZ2ZHdhWkRldFJuX3U5cDhV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foot-Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE9tSm9uYjJ3VDZXYkZ4U1RZanZCRlcyWXdtdzNFSHVjTk1mYzREb09oUUppN3V4NDFTMUhyUTNaS2tDMFA1R0xDZzc2SkhyaXdTbC1XQjdkOVYzTktrWGVzLUtqcXVDVkJfZXJCQlZrX3d3VmYzX2pRaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asociación Almendrón&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&